---
#3959, track §11 and §14.1 `bynk.given.missing_for_call` (reused): a binding's right-hand
side is a capability in the caller's own `given`, so a library reaches nothing its caller
does not.
---
context shop

consumes bynk { Logger }
consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv, D1 }
uses lib.cache

capability Sessions = Kv
capability Archive = Kv
capability Orders = D1

fn save(key: String) -> Effect[String] given Logger {
	remember(key, "v", given Store = Sessions)
}
